#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Learn how to install the development version of the IBM Quantum Compute client."
msgstr "Aprende a instalar la versión de desarrollo del cliente de IBM Quantum Compute."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install the IBM Quantum Compute client from source"
msgstr "Instalar el cliente de IBM Quantum Compute desde el código fuente"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "{/* cspell:ignore rustup */}\n"
msgstr "{/* cspell:ignore rustup */}\n"

#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install the IBM Quantum Compute client from source {#install-the-ibm-quantum-compute-client-from-source}"
msgstr "Instalar el cliente de IBM Quantum Compute desde el código fuente {#install-the-ibm-quantum-compute-client-from-source}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "When you install `qiskit-ibm-runtime` from source, you can access the current development version, instead of using the version in the Python Package Index (PyPI) repository. You can therefore inspect and extend the latest version of the code more efficiently.\n"
msgstr "Cuando instalas `qiskit-ibm-runtime` desde el código fuente, puedes acceder a la versión de desarrollo actual, en lugar de usar la versión del repositorio Python Package Index (PyPI). Por lo tanto, puedes inspeccionar y ampliar la última versión del código de manera más eficiente.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create and activate a new virtual environment {#create-and-activate-a-new-virtual-environment}"
msgstr "Crear y activar un nuevo entorno virtual {#create-and-activate-a-new-virtual-environment}"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Navigate to your project directory and create a minimal environment with only Python installed in it.\n"
msgstr "Navega al directorio de tu proyecto y crea un entorno mínimo con solo Python instalado.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"        <OperatingSystemTabs>\n"
"          <TabItem value=\"mac\" label=\"macOS\">\n"
msgstr ""
"        <OperatingSystemTabs>\n"
"          <TabItem value=\"mac\" label=\"macOS\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"            ```shell\n"
"            python3 -m venv .venv\n"
"            ```\n"
"          </TabItem>\n"
msgstr ""
"            ```shell\n"
"            python3 -m venv .venv\n"
"            ```\n"
"          </TabItem>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "          <TabItem value=\"linux\" label=\"Linux\">\n"
msgstr "          <TabItem value=\"linux\" label=\"Linux\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "          <TabItem value=\"win\" label=\"Windows\">\n"
msgstr "          <TabItem value=\"win\" label=\"Windows\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"            ```text\n"
"            python -m venv .venv\n"
"            ```\n"
"          </TabItem>\n"
"         </OperatingSystemTabs>\n"
msgstr ""
"            ```text\n"
"            python -m venv .venv\n"
"            ```\n"
"          </TabItem>\n"
"         </OperatingSystemTabs>\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Activate your new environment.\n"
msgstr "Activa tu nuevo entorno.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"         <OperatingSystemTabs>\n"
"           <TabItem value=\"mac\" label=\"macOS\">\n"
msgstr ""
"         <OperatingSystemTabs>\n"
"           <TabItem value=\"mac\" label=\"macOS\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"             ```shell\n"
"             source .venv/bin/activate\n"
"             ```\n"
"           </TabItem>\n"
msgstr ""
"             ```shell\n"
"             source .venv/bin/activate\n"
"             ```\n"
"           </TabItem>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "           <TabItem value=\"linux\" label=\"Linux\">\n"
msgstr "           <TabItem value=\"linux\" label=\"Linux\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "           <TabItem value=\"win\" label=\"Windows\">\n"
msgstr "           <TabItem value=\"win\" label=\"Windows\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"             ```text\n"
"             .venv\\Scripts\\Activate.ps1\n"
"             ```\n"
"           </TabItem>\n"
"         </OperatingSystemTabs>\n"
msgstr ""
"             ```text\n"
"             .venv\\Scripts\\Activate.ps1\n"
"             ```\n"
"           </TabItem>\n"
"         </OperatingSystemTabs>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install `qiskit-ibm-runtime` {#install-qiskit-ibm-runtime}"
msgstr "Instalar `qiskit-ibm-runtime` {#install-qiskit-ibm-runtime}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Follow these steps to install `qiskit-ibm-runtime`:\n"
msgstr "Sigue estos pasos para instalar `qiskit-ibm-runtime`:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Clone the `qiskit-ibm-runtime` repository.\n"
msgstr "Clona el repositorio de `qiskit-ibm-runtime`.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Change to the `qiskit-ibm-runtime` directory.\n"
msgstr "Cambia al directorio `qiskit-ibm-runtime`.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install `qiskit-runtime`. We recommend using a [virtual environment](https://docs.python.org/3/library/venv.html) to avoid polluting your global Python installation.\n"
msgstr "Instala `qiskit-runtime`. Recomendamos usar un [entorno virtual](https://docs.python.org/3/library/venv.html) para evitar contaminar tu instalación global de Python.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  * '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Standard install**:\n"
msgstr "**Instalación estándar**:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```bash\n"
"    pip install .\n"
"    ```\n"
msgstr ""
"    ```bash\n"
"    pip install .\n"
"    ```\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  * '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Editable mode**: In this mode, you don't need to reinstall Qiskit when there are code changes to the project.\n"
msgstr "**Modo editable**: En este modo, no necesitas reinstalar Qiskit cuando haya cambios de código en el proyecto.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```bash\n"
"    pip install -e .\n"
"    ```\n"
msgstr ""
"    ```bash\n"
"    pip install -e .\n"
"    ```\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "    In editable mode, the compiled extensions are built in _debug mode_ without optimizations.\n"
msgstr "    En modo editable, las extensiones compiladas se construyen en _modo de depuración_ sin optimizaciones.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "(Optional) If you want to run tests or linting checks, install the developer requirements. We recommend using a [virtual environment](https://docs.python.org/3/library/venv.html) to avoid polluting your global Python installation.\n"
msgstr "(Opcional) Si quieres ejecutar pruebas o verificaciones de linting, instala los requisitos de desarrollador. Recomendamos usar un [entorno virtual](https://docs.python.org/3/library/venv.html) para evitar contaminar tu instalación global de Python.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next steps {#next-steps}"
msgstr "Próximos pasos {#next-steps}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
"  - Read the [contributing guidelines](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-ibm-runtime/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md) to contribute to `qiskit-ibm-runtime`.\n"
"  - [Install the Qiskit SDK from source](/guides/install-qiskit-source).\n"
"  - [Run your first program](/guides/hello-world).\n"
"  - Try a tutorial, such as [Grover's algorithm](/tutorials/grovers-algorithm).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recomendaciones\">\n"
"  - Lee las [directrices de contribución](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-ibm-runtime/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md) para contribuir a `qiskit-ibm-runtime`.\n"
"  - [Instala el SDK de Qiskit desde el código fuente](/guides/install-qiskit-source).\n"
"  - [Ejecuta tu primer programa](/guides/hello-world).\n"
"  - Prueba un tutorial, como [el algoritmo de Grover](/tutorials/grovers-algorithm).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
